   are trademarks of their respective owners.

3. At your own risk. You use the program at your own risk. Fog Scout only reads screen
   pixels and window information, does not modify game files, does not access the game
   process and sends no input to the game. Still, nobody can promise how Behaviour
   Interactive or an anti-cheat system judges an external program. There is no
   assurance that using it will not lead to a warning, a ban or the loss of a game
   account. Whether you use it is your decision; following the game's rules is your
   responsibility.

4. No warranty. The program is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind,
   including accuracy, availability or fitness for a particular purpose.

5. Liability. To the extent permitted by law, the author is not liable for any damage
   arising from the use of or the inability to use the program, in particular not for
